# Lychee ignore patterns - regex patterns for URLs to skip during link checking.
# Adapted from link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template.

# Localhost and local development URLs
https?://localhost
https?://127\.0\.0\.1

# Example and placeholder URLs
https?://example\.com

# npm and Medium return 403 to link checkers (bot protection)
https://www\.npmjs\.com
https://medium\.com

# Web Archive rejects automated checks despite serving browser requests
https://web\.archive\.org
